{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "This week I will be closing on my first house that I plan on renovating and selling in the next few months.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/6ec46d2259f0c891cf69c917017a9eaf922d4fab6cfa337161ed30f70a8d34c6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.94], [3, 0.94, 1.06], [4, 1.06, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 1.82], [8, 1.82, 2.14], [9, 2.14, 2.4], [10, 2.4, 2.66], [11, 2.66, 2.74], [12, 2.74, 2.98], [13, 2.98, 3.18], [14, 3.18, 3.64], [15, 3.64, 3.8], [16, 3.8, 4.1], [17, 4.1, 4.3], [18, 4.3, 4.38], [19, 4.38, 4.58], [20, 4.58, 4.8], [21, 4.8, 5.14]]}, {"text": "I have been looking for a low-end flip for over a year now and I finally found one via NetWorth Reality in Atlanta.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/99bd41e0cf7c4fa1c721235b373688443d9d0fe4e7bcaf0313531c524f0ef0ff.mp3"}, {"text": "Throughout this year long process, I have learned tons about the Atlanta real estate market and in general what to look for in purchasing an investment property.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/d654cc3342e6cac2782b87b5bd5969943469b1331542659c2434dbd21918691c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.02], [4, 1.02, 1.54], [7, 2.3, 2.52], [8, 2.52, 2.96], [9, 2.96, 3.3], [10, 3.3, 3.46], [11, 3.46, 3.72], [12, 3.72, 3.94], [13, 3.94, 4.2], [14, 4.2, 4.6], [15, 4.6, 4.84], [16, 4.84, 4.92], [17, 4.92, 5.3], [18, 5.3, 5.5], [19, 5.5, 5.66], [20, 5.66, 5.82], [21, 5.82, 6.04], [22, 6.04, 6.2], [23, 6.2, 6.56], [24, 6.56, 6.82], [25, 6.82, 7.18], [26, 7.18, 7.66]]}, {"text": "My criteria for my first purchase has been:", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/70b763af38522ed1c63a42c7f9fb57c1d95e7e2e2d0b79d76dfd1f72b95ffd1b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.68], [2, 0.68, 0.92], [3, 0.92, 1.06], [4, 1.06, 1.32], [5, 1.32, 1.62], [6, 1.62, 1.92], [7, 1.92, 2.2]]}, {"text": "The property value + $15k (for wiggle room) must be within my budget", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/ed4cd42b851e2f851def2143768bf7c8157c97f523965d62b7f325b29cef3586.mp3"}, {"text": "No seriously large repairs should be necessary.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/ba5c975d493acb74187672032e3138f689e432d3fbb70c0395d84ac9c07531a8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.64], [2, 0.94, 1.16], [3, 1.16, 1.5], [4, 1.5, 1.78], [5, 1.78, 1.92], [6, 1.92, 2.46]]}, {"text": "(roof and foundation need to be in good condition)", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/a7309395e0a7b81f97f20d54ace926446484ac9716841e27b60ef2df338945cc.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.8], [1, 0.8, 1.04], [2, 1.04, 1.6], [3, 1.6, 1.92], [4, 1.92, 2.06], [5, 2.06, 2.16], [6, 2.16, 2.28], [7, 2.28, 2.42], [8, 2.42, 2.86]]}, {"text": "Near my residence", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/4f48fff44bb02b8ee11e60491328897cb597540a10d3f808a241ba0f68b59dcd.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.88]]}, {"text": "Low crime neighborhood.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/877d6e571cdb9754bf780b1846854c9a9f6ba435a59a12e97fdcb848fb913f77.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 1.02]]}, {"text": "Zoned for good schools.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/594f770641a7c681cb0d557443cf57f5c68c0d366369046d522420d8d10e643d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 1.08]]}, {"text": "Zillow and comparable houses needed agree on the value of the home*.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/09d7bf7db9c05dce461757ccd87119d5974a5b6ea90d3ab58196ee3fe3de1806.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.5], [1, 0.5, 0.7], [2, 0.7, 1.06], [3, 1.06, 1.5], [4, 1.5, 1.82], [6, 2.12, 2.26], [7, 2.26, 2.38], [8, 2.38, 2.68], [9, 2.68, 2.82], [10, 2.82, 2.94], [11, 2.94, 3.16]]}, {"text": "Best-case estimated profit needs to be at least $15,000.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/c0c7fc7b2fb6d845f2b01ad9fb9aec4f44e27025c5bed7f8d6dd4821a8bfff77.mp3"}, {"text": "Must be able to be sold quickly at a higher value", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/dccf8245f2be068cd261645666742fb327e6f35a04fd33d3f348d088152a21f8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 0.9], [5, 0.9, 1.14], [6, 1.14, 1.58], [7, 1.58, 1.88], [8, 1.88, 1.98], [9, 1.98, 2.22], [10, 2.22, 2.7]]}, {"text": "No condos (typically have high Homeowners Association fees and renting restrictions)", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/4ec37a8141c007bd2c234f2c208af3b61dda8cef5c46c651fbd6494a135854a5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.74], [2, 0.74, 1.04], [3, 1.04, 1.34], [4, 1.34, 1.54], [5, 1.54, 1.88], [6, 1.88, 2.56], [7, 2.56, 3.02], [8, 3.02, 3.28], [9, 3.28, 3.52], [10, 3.52, 4.02]]}, {"text": "The house I am buying meets most of the criteria, although its location is about 30 minutes away one direction.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/fb030a2250723ff22b63aaba4d6631ae8b59af0c607e765ff1223a1a45f1e69d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.72], [4, 0.72, 0.96], [5, 0.96, 1.24], [6, 1.24, 1.64], [7, 1.64, 1.86], [8, 1.86, 1.98], [9, 1.98, 2.54], [10, 3.04, 3.22], [11, 3.22, 3.42], [12, 3.42, 3.86], [13, 3.86, 4.12], [14, 4.12, 4.32], [15, 4.32, 4.72], [16, 4.72, 4.92], [17, 4.92, 5.2], [18, 5.2, 5.46], [19, 5.46, 5.82]]}, {"text": "As a developer that sells his time, I am not excited about having to drive that on a weekly (daily?!)", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/112e078f3e68a3d5eb26fb05ae51acb71740e467f6cac6685be4baf6a4b22149.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.06], [5, 1.06, 1.32], [6, 1.32, 1.58], [7, 1.88, 1.9], [8, 1.9, 2.02], [9, 2.02, 2.2], [10, 2.2, 2.6], [11, 2.6, 2.84], [12, 2.84, 3.06], [13, 3.06, 3.26], [14, 3.26, 3.5], [15, 3.5, 3.74], [16, 3.74, 3.94], [17, 3.94, 4.02], [18, 4.02, 4.34], [19, 4.86, 5.08]]}, {"text": "basis, but I plan on outsourcing as much of the property management that I can.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/abc6e7ecdff65db4aab7f975ef9d290de462ec36b69859a2239b74b54f812e46.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.52], [1, 0.68, 0.78], [2, 0.78, 0.88], [3, 0.88, 1.08], [4, 1.08, 1.22], [5, 1.22, 1.76], [6, 1.76, 1.96], [7, 1.96, 2.16], [8, 2.16, 2.3], [9, 2.3, 2.4], [10, 2.4, 2.7], [11, 2.7, 3.12], [12, 3.12, 3.36], [13, 3.36, 3.46], [14, 3.46, 3.7]]}, {"text": "Once the repairs are finished on the property, I want to sell this property as soon as I can, because I don’t have time to manage renters or property repairs.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/d4940c98720c74df2963e9a4af48ee35275087c89bb68f7260f2a22b23930a42.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 1.06], [4, 1.06, 1.46], [5, 1.46, 1.68], [6, 1.68, 1.8], [7, 1.8, 2.14], [8, 2.72, 2.8], [9, 2.8, 2.96], [10, 2.96, 3.08], [11, 3.08, 3.24], [12, 3.24, 3.42], [13, 3.42, 3.84], [14, 3.84, 4.06], [15, 4.06, 4.26], [16, 4.26, 4.42], [17, 4.42, 4.54], [18, 4.54, 4.9], [19, 5.3, 5.56], [20, 5.56, 5.72], [21, 5.72, 5.86], [22, 5.86, 6.02], [23, 6.02, 6.34], [24, 6.34, 6.5], [25, 6.5, 6.8], [26, 6.8, 7.28], [27, 7.28, 7.52], [28, 7.52, 7.96], [29, 7.96, 8.36]]}, {"text": "While I already have interest from one person to rent from the house,", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/541a59653b7858d86c851ae94d1a190ba2fb918651f164de4a5c810bd8998881.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.24], [5, 1.24, 1.46], [6, 1.46, 1.66], [7, 1.66, 2.06], [8, 2.06, 2.36], [9, 2.36, 2.54], [10, 2.54, 2.7], [11, 2.7, 2.82], [12, 2.82, 3.12]]}, {"text": "Hopefully this will be a profitable endeavor, but it could just end up being an expensive learning experience.", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/6a375d940ab60f1a66902ef65aaf7c259d2f85fdba53265f7c2dbbf1a2ea657e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.42], [1, 0.42, 0.68], [2, 0.68, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.08], [5, 1.08, 1.54], [6, 1.54, 1.96], [7, 2.4, 2.58], [8, 2.58, 2.7], [9, 2.7, 2.8], [10, 2.8, 2.98], [11, 2.98, 3.22], [12, 3.22, 3.34], [13, 3.34, 3.5], [14, 3.5, 3.76], [15, 3.76, 4.2], [16, 4.2, 4.54], [17, 4.54, 5.14]]}, {"text": "While I agree that Zillow doesn’t know what it is talking about when it comes to home values.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/da84cafe02e78f0722156cc0a128bffb5818eca6bef9a51bf2920f9c99c9b3d3.mp3", "words": [[2, 0.3, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.96], [4, 0.96, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.86], [6, 1.86, 2.14], [7, 2.14, 2.42], [8, 2.42, 2.52], [9, 2.52, 2.68], [10, 2.68, 3.0], [11, 3.0, 3.32], [12, 3.32, 3.54], [13, 3.54, 3.68], [14, 3.68, 3.84], [15, 3.84, 4.06], [16, 4.06, 4.26], [17, 4.26, 4.68]]}, {"text": "I also think that the people buying the homes would not want to purchase a house too far off the price listed online.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/2cd935d0d5347926f7371db7043a900d89579cca77b45d07bbcf0944652d1c88.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 0.96], [5, 0.96, 1.2], [6, 1.2, 1.48], [7, 1.48, 1.66], [8, 1.66, 1.86], [9, 1.86, 2.06], [10, 2.06, 2.24], [11, 2.24, 2.4], [12, 2.4, 2.54], [13, 2.54, 2.8], [14, 2.8, 2.98], [15, 2.98, 3.18], [16, 3.18, 3.42], [17, 3.42, 3.7], [18, 3.7, 3.96], [19, 3.96, 4.1], [20, 4.1, 4.34], [21, 4.34, 4.68], [22, 4.68, 5.08]]}, {"text": "The house I bought Zillow thinks is worth $115k and I purchased it for $47k.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/f99ba76bf7a9d4858b5bc06ac7e989d803120c4049f3a616fc74c35136ac1da4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [2, 0.42, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.68], [4, 0.68, 1.12], [5, 1.12, 1.42], [6, 1.42, 1.72], [7, 1.72, 1.96], [8, 1.96, 3.36], [9, 3.36, 4.06], [10, 4.06, 4.2], [11, 4.2, 4.52], [12, 4.52, 4.78], [13, 4.78, 4.92], [14, 4.92, 5.84]]}]}